    <senderName>LU</senderName>
    <headline>Floods on the Moselle</headline>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Information/End of floods&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Water levels on the Moselle have reached their peak. Water levels are falling and are soon once again below the ‘Cote de vigilance jaune’.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Water levels are expected to continue falling on Sunday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The awareness level floods for the Moselle has been cancelled. Currently no risk of floods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow the situation, possible changes in awareness levels and possible other active warnings.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
